\pard\sa120\b\fs20 2. Important notices\b0\par
\pard\sa60\fs20 - PasswordManager is 100% local and offline: your vaults stay in %LocalAppData%\\PasswordManager and are never sent over the internet.\par
\pard\sa60\fs20 - There is no master password recovery. If you forget your password, the vault cannot be opened. Keep your password in a safe place.\par
\pard\sa60\fs20 - Make regular backups (Export .vault) and store the file somewhere safe.\par
\pard\sa60\fs20 - Updating or uninstalling the application never deletes your vaults and settings.\par
\pard\sa120\fs20 - This version's installer is not digitally signed. Verify the SHA256 hash published in the GitHub Release before installing.\par
